        "displayLine1": "A WORD",
        "displayLine2": "ON THE",
        "displayLine3": "UNSEEN",
        "body": "The loudest voices rarely own the room. Confidence without an audience is the rarest kind. These five marks reveal who already possesses it.",
        "handle": "@thequietedit",
        "slideId": "Slide 02"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE QUIET EDIT",
        "scriptPrefix": "First",
        "displayLine1": "SILENT",
        "displayLine2": "BUILDING",
        "displayLine3": "IN PRIVATE",
        "body": "They work without announcements, deadlines, or public accountability. Progress is documented in notebooks, not notifications. The foundation sets long before the reveal.",
        "handle": "@thequietedit",
        "slideId": "Slide 03"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE QUIET EDIT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Second",
        "displayLine1": "NO EXTERNAL",
        "displayLine2": "VALIDATION",
        "displayLine3": "REQUIRED",
        "body": "Likes cannot inflate what is already full. They measure success by internal standards, not algorithmic approval. Their compass is self-calibrated and steady.",
        "handle": "@thequietedit",
        "slideId": "Slide 04"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE QUIET EDIT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Third",
        "displayLine1": "THEY LISTEN",
        "displayLine2": "MORE THAN",
        "displayLine3": "THEY SPEAK",
        "body": "Quiet confidence listens to understand, not to respond. They ask precise questions and absorb the answers. Power gathers information before it ever commands.",
        "handle": "@thequietedit",
        "slideId": "Slide 05"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE QUIET EDIT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Fourth",
        "displayLine1": "ACTION WITHOUT",
        "displayLine2": "CROWDSOURCED",
        "displayLine3": "PERMISSION",
        "body": "They do not poll the room before deciding. Intuition is trusted over consensus. Speed and solitude replace committee and noise every single time.",
        "handle": "@thequietedit",
        "slideId": "Slide 06"
      }
    },
    {
      "layoutId": "body-noir-yellow",
      "slots": {
        "brand": "THE QUIET EDIT",
        "scriptPrefix": "Fifth",
        "displayLine1": "RESULTS MAKE",
        "displayLine2": "ALL THE",
        "displayLine3": "NOISE NEEDED",
        "body": "The outcome arrives before the announcement ever could. They let legacy speak instead of stories. Proof is always louder than promised volume.",
